<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέλεγ-κτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not cross-questioned, safe
				from being questioned,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γλῶττα ἀ. ἡμῖν ἔσται, ἡ δὲ φρὴν
					οὐκ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					154d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				41b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not refuted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐᾶν τινὰ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					467a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μοι καὶ ἀ. ἡ μαντεία γένοιτο</span>”
				<i>irrefutable,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					22a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				29b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, λεγόμενον</span>
			<i>without refutation</i> or <i>reply,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons
			also, <i>without trial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. διαφυγεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.53
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
